        {
          "title": "Windows",
          "bullets": [
            "螢幕和視窗捕獲使用 Windows Graphics Capture。",
            "游標和點選能力取決於 Windows 捕獲路徑提供的內容。",
            "互動訪問不需要 Linux Polkit helper。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "macOS",
          "tables": [
            {
              "headers": ["能力", "要求"],
              "rows": [
